      231.89,
      372.57,
      243.23
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO REPEAL THE RENT ACT, NO. 7 OF 1972",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      260.09,
      401.9,
      285.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      302.45,
      401.91,
      370.19
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Rent (Repeal)Act, No. of 2024 and shall come into operation on the dateon which the certificate is endorsed in respect of this Act interms of Article 79 of the Constitution (in this Act referred toas the \"relevant date\").",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      387.05,
      380.03,
      398.39
    ],
    "text": "2. The Rent Act, No. 7 of 1972 is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      429.29,
      401.88,
      468.83
    ],
    "text": "3. Notwithstanding the repeal of the Rent Act, No. 7 of1972 (in this section referred to as the \"repealed Act\") bysection 2 of this Act-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      183.81,
      485.69,
      401.89,
      567.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)no action shall be instituted for the ejectment of atenant who is in possession of any premisesgoverned by the provisions of the repealed Acton the day immediately preceding the relevantdate, for a period of one year from the relevantdate;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      183.81,
      584.45,
      401.89,
      666.35
    ],
    "text": "(b)no landlord of any premises governed by theprovisions of the repealed Act on the dayimmediately preceding the relevant date, shalldemand or receive any rent in excess of theauthorised rent payable under the repealed Act,for a period of one year from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      144.69,
      613.49,
      155.13,
      624.83
    ],
